===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*treuwu}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*trewwō}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|dum|trouwe}} ({{cog|nl|trouw}}), {{cog|osx|treuwa}}, {{cog|goh|triuwa}} ({{cog|de|Treue}}).

====Noun====
{{ang-noun|f|head=trēow}}

# [[truth]] to a promise; [[faith]]
# [[truth]] to a person; [[fidelity]], [[fealty]], [[loyalty]]
# [[grace]], [[favour]], [[help]]
# an assurance of [[faith]]; [[word]], [[promise]], [[engagement]], [[covenant]], [[league]]

